          "messageValues": [
            {
              "message": "=prompt: `=You are an intent classifier for a real estate platform.  Classify the user input into EXACTLY ONE intent:  \"validate\" - User is asking whether their OWN listing's price, size, or details               are correct, fair, or competitive.              Examples:              - \"is my 2000 sqft flat at 3000/sqft too much?\"              - \"is this price reasonable for Gulshan?\"              - \"am I pricing my apartment correctly?\"  \"inquiry\"  - User asks a specific question about a property that has an ID               matching the pattern: bproperty-XXXXX (e.g. bproperty-11975).              Examples:              - \"does bproperty-11975 have a gym?\"              - \"what floor is bproperty-203 on?\"              - \"is bproperty-5 pet friendly?\"  \"search\"   - User wants to find or browse properties matching criteria.              Examples:              - \"find me apartments in Khilgaon under 50 lakhs\"              - \"show 3 bedroom flats in Dhanmondi\"  Return ONLY the lowercase intent word. If unclear, default to \"search\".  User input: {{ $json.chatInput }}`"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
